~ JACK_start
# CONDITION: Must be a new day to get the next dialog. Not exactly day two but
# time must progress once. 
if Storage.sf.story_complete and Storage.sf.days != Storage.sf.day_story_completed:
	=> JACK_day2_start
if Storage.sf.story_complete:
	...
	=> END!
Holy carp! A real Human!
Oh, get your shells together,[wait=0.2] you been waiting for this moment.
You can call me Jack! Welcome to the Black Lake. Oh,[wait=0.2] how fin-tastic to see you here!
Not everyone has a name here,[wait=0.2] so you might say I am special! Not like they care but I kept my name so I can tell it to another Human! What is yours??
- Stare at Jack's face
Come on now,[wait=0.2] I don't look that bad! I mean,[wait=0.2] I might not have smooth skin like yours,[wait=0.2] but I walk the same earth you do. Also,[wait=0.2] you should see the town… Then you will come running to me.
Since you didn't bestow me your name,[wait=0.2] I will call you… Hmmm…
Okay. It's o[wait=0.2]-fish-[wait=0.2]ial. I name you,[wait=0.2] Bob! How cool! I named my first Human,[wait=0.2] can't wait to show you to the Son.
No fins? How weird! you don't have gills either… I guess any-fin is possible!
Don't go fishing for compliments now,[wait=0.2] others will not even realise that you are a Human. Except for some.
Speaking of fishing… Follow me,[wait=0.2] let me show you how we spend our days here.
set Storage.sf.jack_state = "ToLake"
do SceneManager.switch(SceneManager.freeroam_context())
=> END

~ JACK_patrol_tutorial
Just over there! My favourite spot to fish,[wait=0.2] it will be so much fun!
=> END

~ JACK_tutorial_intro
if Storage.sf.fish_caught > 0:
	=> JACK_tutorial_outcome
Come! come,[wait=0.2] oh! There should be some bait right over there. Now,[wait=0.2] just go ahead and put some in your mouth.
- Look at the bucket
	HAHAHA,[wait=0.2] STOPP!
- Hell no
	Ok,[wait=0.2] Ok.[wait=0.2] Clam down...
Just squidding! It is for the fish,[wait=0.2] not for Humans! What a silly jellyball you are.
=> JACK_tutorial_ui

~ JACK_tutorial_ui
Go ahead and open your logbook with “I”.
=> JACK_tutorial_fish

~ JACK_tutorial_fish
Cast your line into the lake and reel when it bites!
=> END

~ JACK_tutorial_outcome
Holy mackerel,[wait=0.2] that is a big one! So its true... Humans catch better fish! We might have a chance after all!
I am getting ahead of myself,[wait=0.2] you dont even know about our fish races.
It's time to shell-abrate.
Every night,[wait=0.2] we gather together at the port to race our fishes,[wait=0.2] its really fun! Son used to come out to watch it,[wait=0.2] transform the best fish to a Human.
Well,[wait=0.2] that was his plan. He tried to make us Human,[wait=0.2] but could not sucseed the way he envisioned. He wanted to create "Beautiful" creatures,[wait=0.2] not freaks of nature!
I think that is a load of carp.
After his many "failed" attempts,[wait=0.2] he turned bitter,[wait=0.2] angry,[wait=0.2] resentfull against us. Locked himself in his shack,[wait=0.2] told us to find a real Human to catch the fish. Wouldnt accept our fishes,[wait=0.2] even if they won the race!
What a shellfish fella,[wait=0.2] am I right?
He is kinda boring now... But,[wait=0.2] I do want more Fish-folk to talk with! I know everyone here already,[wait=0.2] been so long since we had a new face around.
Like,[wait=0.2] krill out,[wait=0.2] man. Go smoke some swamp weed or something.
Ugh,[wait=0.2] enough of that depressing shit. Also,[wait=0.2] since you are here,[wait=0.2] maybe we can finally put an end to this era of silence!
Let me show you the town,[wait=0.2] its not much,[wait=0.2] but its everything we got!
set Storage.sf.jack_state = "ToTown"
do SceneManager.switch(SceneManager.freeroam_context())
=> END!

~ JACK_patrol_town
What do you call an octopus without shoes? 
A sock-topus.
Hehehehehe,[wait=0.2] gotta stay octo-mistic!
=> END

~ JACK_in_town
Well,[wait=0.2] this is the town! Near the dock,[wait=0.2] you can find the stall,[wait=0.2] you will need it to upgrade your rod.
I dont like the guy who works the stall,[wait=0.2] buuuut—
As they say,[wait=0.2] keep your friends close,[wait=0.2] anemones closer ;)
Dont forget! You can fish anywhere where there is water.
NOW GO! Blend in,[wait=0.2] there is so much to do!
set Storage.sf.jack_state = "ToHome"
do SceneManager.switch(SceneManager.freeroam_context())
=> END

~ JACK_patrol_back_home
What is a fish's favorite type of joke? Whale jokes. They're really a killer!
=> END

~ JACK_day2_start
Morning,[wait=0.2] Bobsy! How can I kelp you today?
- Look at towards the racing port
	Be at the port by nightfall. Bring your fastest catch,[wait=0.2] and some luck!
- Look at towards Son's shack
	Shelled up and sulking. But a real victory might reel him to the shore again.
	He had a girlfriend,[wait=0.2] but then he lobster.
	- Smile
		Hahaha,[wait=0.2] I see you kraken up!
	- DONT smile
		oOoOoO.[wait=0.2] so-fish-ticated... Keep your smile,[wait=0.2] save it for another day.
- Leave
Keep your line tight!
=> END!

